<title>UK: Milupa baby milk withdrawn in Britain.</title>
<headline>Milupa baby milk withdrawn in Britain.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Health said it advised shopowners and consumers to stop selling and using Milupa Milumil, a baby milk which commands around nine percent of the British market.</p>
<p>A spokesman said this followed fears about a possible association between the product and salmonella.</p>
